{"id": "3139087", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3139087", "title": "Monterrey Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Monterrey Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii august 2024. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Monterrey, Mexic, disputat pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103. Iuliana Lizarazo \u0219i Mar\u00eda Paulina P\u00e9rez Garc\u00eda\nau fost campioanele \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar Lizarazo nu a participat \u00een acest an. P\u00e9rez o are ca partener\u0103 pe Natalija Stevanovi\u0107.\nGuo Hanyu \u0219i Monica Niculescu au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu la Monterrey Open 2024, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-le \u00een final\u0103 pe Giuliana Olmos \u0219i Alexandra Panova, 3\u20136, 6\u20133, [10\u20134]."}
