{"id": "3139240", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3139240", "title": "Winston-Salem Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Winston-Salem Open 2024 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii august 2024. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103tori s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Winston-Salem, Carolina de Nord, SUA, jucat pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103, \u00een exterior.\nCampionii \u00een exerci\u021biu Nathaniel Lammons \u0219i Jackson Withrow au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu la Winston-Salem Open 2024, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-i pe Julian Cash \u0219i Robert Galloway \u00een final\u0103, 6\u20134, 6\u20133."}
